-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §7 עובדי הוראה קיימים: in תשע"ב–תשע"ד an
-- existing teaching employee in a reform school is employed under the
-- reform, as far as the school applies it, if he gave written notice that
-- he joins (a principal without notice); one who joined keeps it when he
-- moves school; from תשע"ה every teaching employee is under the reform,
-- save by an exceptions committee's leave; those below a third of a
-- position or without a licence or a degree are kept off it; and from
-- תשע"ג the reform is the threshold for a role.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-6`

§ `7 עובדי הוראה קיימים`

@desc An existing teaching employee in a school year, as far as §7 asks.
DECLARE `Oz existing teaching employee's year` HAS
    `qualifications`                     IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
    `the school year`                    IS A NUMBER @desc by the calendar year it opens in: 2011 is תשע"ב
    `how far the school applies the reform` IS A `extent of the Oz reform` @desc by the Ministry's list for the year (§5(א))
    `is the school's principal`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `gave written notice of joining`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc on the Ministry's form (7(ב), 7(ד))
    `his terms before he moved school`   IS A `extent of the Oz reform` @desc off the reform if he did not move, or was not under it
    `released by the exceptions committee for the year` IS A BOOLEAN @desc 7(ז)

§§ `7(ח)`

-- (ח): notwithstanding the rest of §7, these existing teaching employees
-- are not employed under the reform: (1) one employed below a third of a
-- position (with the employers, together); (2) one not entitled to a
-- permanent licence or a licence to teach, or without an academic degree,
-- save (א) one whose field has no relevant academic education and who
-- holds, or will be given, a permit by the Ministry's instructions, and
-- (ב) one whose technological education is relevant to the field he
-- teaches.
@ref akn:art_7__para_h akn:art_7__para_h__subpara_1 akn:art_7__para_h__subpara_2 akn:art_7__para_h__subpara_2__cls_a akn:art_7__para_h__subpara_2__cls_b
GIVEN q IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` q IF
       `employed below a third of a position` q
    OR (    NOT `holds a licence and a degree` q
        AND NOT q's `teaches a field with no relevant academic education, with a permit`
        AND NOT q's `holds technological education relevant to the field taught`)

§§ `7(א)–(ו)`

-- (א): in תשע"ב–תשע"ד, an existing teaching employee in a school where the
-- reform is applied is employed under it, as far as the school applies it.
-- (ב): notwithstanding (א), one who did not give written notice, on the
-- Ministry's form, that he wishes to join is not. (ג): (ב) does not apply
-- to the principal of such a school, who is under the reform as far as his
-- school applies it. (ד): one who gave notice is under it as (א) says, and
-- may not change his notice. (ה): one who began under the reform and moved
-- to a school that has not applied it yet stays under it. (ו):
-- notwithstanding (א), one under the reform in full who moved to a school
-- that applies it in part stays under it in full.
@ref akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_d akn:art_7__para_e akn:art_7__para_f
GIVEN t IS A `Oz existing teaching employee's year`
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `the terms in the gradual years` t IS
    BRANCH
        IF t's `his terms before he moved school` EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
           AND NOT t's `how far the school applies the reform` EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
        THEN `the Oz reform in full`
        IF t's `how far the school applies the reform` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
           AND NOT t's `his terms before he moved school` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
        THEN t's `his terms before he moved school`
        IF t's `is the school's principal`
           OR t's `gave written notice of joining`
           OR NOT t's `his terms before he moved school` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
        THEN t's `how far the school applies the reform`
        OTHERWISE `off the Oz reform`

-- (ד), last words: a notice of joining cannot be taken back.
`a notice of joining may be changed` MEANS FALSE

DECLARE `Oz section 7 action` IS ONE OF
    `prepare the form for joining the Oz reform`
    `set up the exceptions committee of the Oz reform`

-- (ב), (ד): the notice is given on a form the Ministry prepares (no
-- deadline: convention dates.no-deadline).
`preparing the joining form` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `prepare the form for joining the Oz reform`

§§ `7(ז)`

-- (ז): from תשע"ה every teaching employee is employed under the reform. An
-- exceptions committee, which the Ministry sets up as the Director-
-- General's letter of 14.8.2011 details, hears individual teaching
-- employees who ask, for special or personal reasons, not to be; its leave
-- holds for one school year unless it decides otherwise. On what grounds it
-- gives leave is the letter's, which the corpus does not hold: whether it
-- gave leave for the year is a fact of the case.
@ref akn:art_7__para_g
`setting up the exceptions committee` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `set up the exceptions committee of the Oz reform`

`why the exceptions committee's grounds are not encoded` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "מכתב מנכ\"ל משרד החינוך מיום 14.8.2011 (ועדת החריגים)"

GIVEN t IS A `Oz existing teaching employee's year`
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `the terms from 5775` t IS
    IF t's `released by the exceptions committee for the year`
    THEN `off the Oz reform`
    ELSE `the Oz reform in full`

§§ `7 -- the terms`

-- The section whole: (ח) first, "על אף האמור בסעיף זה"; then (ז) from
-- תשע"ה, and (א)–(ו) in תשע"ב–תשע"ד. Before תשע"ב there is no reform.
@ref akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_g akn:art_7__para_h
GIVEN t IS A `Oz existing teaching employee's year`
GIVETH A `extent of the Oz reform`
DECIDE `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` t IS
    BRANCH
        IF `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (t's `qualifications`)
        THEN `off the Oz reform`
        IF t's `the school year` AT LEAST `the school year 5775`
        THEN `the terms from 5775` t
        IF t's `the school year` AT LEAST `the school year 5772`
        THEN `the terms in the gradual years` t
        OTHERWISE `off the Oz reform`

§§ `7(ט)`

-- (ט): from תשע"ג, in a school where the reform is applied, being employed
-- under it is a threshold condition for a role that carries a role
-- allowance or role hours. It is a condition, not an entitlement: §17 says
-- who gets a role's allowance or hours.
@ref akn:art_7__para_i
GIVEN t IS A `Oz existing teaching employee's year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets section 7(ט)'s threshold for a role` t IF
       t's `the school year` LESS THAN `the school year 5773`
    OR t's `how far the school applies the reform` EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
    OR NOT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` t EQUALS `off the Oz reform`

§§ `7 -- illustrations`

`a qualified full-time teacher` MEANS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 1 TRUE TRUE FALSE

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, school IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, notice IS A BOOLEAN, before IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
GIVETH A `Oz existing teaching employee's year`
DECIDE `a qualified teacher's year` y school notice before IS
    `Oz existing teaching employee's year` WITH
        `qualifications`                     IS `a qualified full-time teacher`
        `the school year`                    IS y
        `how far the school applies the reform` IS school
        `is the school's principal`          IS FALSE
        `gave written notice of joining`     IS notice
        `his terms before he moved school`   IS before
        `released by the exceptions committee for the year` IS FALSE

-- (א) and (ד): notice given, in a school that applies the reform in part
#ASSERT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5773` `the Oz reform in part` TRUE `off the Oz reform`) EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`
-- (ב): no notice, no reform, in the gradual years
#ASSERT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5773` `the Oz reform in full` FALSE `off the Oz reform`) EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
-- (ו): from full to a school applying it in part
#ASSERT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5774` `the Oz reform in part` FALSE `the Oz reform in full`) EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
-- (א): one who joined elsewhere, in part, and moved to a school that applies it in full
#ASSERT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5774` `the Oz reform in full` FALSE `the Oz reform in part`) EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
-- (ה): to a school that has not applied it yet
#ASSERT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5774` `off the Oz reform` FALSE `the Oz reform in part`) EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`
-- (ז): from תשע"ה, notice or not
#ASSERT `the terms section 7 gives an existing teaching employee` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5775` `off the Oz reform` FALSE `off the Oz reform`) EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
-- (ט): from תשע"ג, a teacher off the reform in a reform school may not take a role
#ASSERT NOT `meets section 7(ט)'s threshold for a role` (`a qualified teacher's year` `the school year 5773` `the Oz reform in full` FALSE `off the Oz reform`)
-- (ח)(2)(ב): technological education saves an existing teacher without a degree
#ASSERT NOT `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (`the qualifications of a teacher at` 1 TRUE FALSE TRUE)

-- F-oz-founding-7-a: from תשע"ה (ז) says "כל עובדי ההוראה", and the only
-- bar it yields to, (ח), names existing teaching employees. A new teacher
-- below a third of a position, whom §6(ב) takes out of §6(א), is then
-- under the reform by (ז)'s words, and off it if (ז) is read, as its
-- section's heading says, of existing teaching employees only.
`a new teacher at a quarter of a position` MEANS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 0.25 TRUE TRUE FALSE

GIVEN q IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `(ז)'s words bring under the reform a new teacher §6(ב) takes out` q IF
        `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` q
    AND `the terms section 6 gives a new teaching employee in` `the school year 5775` q EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
    AND `the terms from 5775` (`Oz existing teaching employee's year` WITH
            `qualifications`                     IS q
            `the school year`                    IS `the school year 5775`
            `how far the school applies the reform` IS `the Oz reform in full`
            `is the school's principal`          IS FALSE
            `gave written notice of joining`     IS FALSE
            `his terms before he moved school`   IS `off the Oz reform`
            `released by the exceptions committee for the year` IS FALSE) EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`

#ASSERT `(ז)'s words bring under the reform a new teacher §6(ב) takes out` `a new teacher at a quarter of a position`
